Find (scripted fake client):

- Single-shot validates the structured response (TestFind_SingleShot).
- Interactive submission (TestFind_Interactive_OK).
- No final call -> `INCOMPLETE_NO_SUBMISSION`, never `NO_FINDINGS`, with a
